    "title": "Smith Street Closure and Sewer Repairs to Affect Perth Amboy Residents Starting Early December - NewsBreak",
    "text": "11 hours ago B & W Construction Co. of NJ, Inc. will begin repairs on the sanitary and storm sewer system along Smith Street in Perth Amboy, New Jersey, around December 1, 2025, depending on weather conditions. The work will take place between McCellan Street and Madison Avenue and is expected to last about five days.\nSmith Street will be fully closed in this section at all times during the project. Detours will be marked. Signs will show that all businesses remain open. Residents and business owners should follow posted directions. For more information, contact B & W Construction.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.\n1",
